figure><figure><img alt=\"MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013045455623688192396170.jpeg/Amp94kGdLf9gkGF7dTT9iQ5YPxtQj-X-o_k_FqP5PxY\"/><figcaption>MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013045457972629504031965.jpeg/_V4n6qljbUAYBwhLyzN0zP0m_qseNUrJwOFlOcDhZTk\"/><figcaption>MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013045447868026880436058.jpeg/rABTRxkAPVrzZVfOFR25PnI6l909T1dDu6BNP7ugTT8\"/><figcaption>MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013045450539929600825093.jpeg/YooKv2p0Laet49VCQTojuNpuW_t4kV2AWKCPvligj74\"/><figcaption>MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250621/1013045448136462336512847.jpeg/AoiZyWEinlQofe-iPXqcYhhANRTCYQabiCOG_Ygjhv0\"/><figcaption>MetaGen Therapeutics官網上的介紹。（chomusubi.metagentx.com）</figcaption></figure><p>上班族早餐這樣吃！網友熱議八大早餐品項 營養均衡、快速便利怎麼選？</p><p>半夜餓醒嗑牛肉麵、泡麵？醫：腸胃被迫加班容易讓胃酸、睡眠失控</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T04:18:04.567866+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2374,"images":29,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}